      "text": "<<singleton>>  SplitwiseService\n───────────────────────────────────────────────\n- users:  Map<String, User>      (ConcurrentHashMap)\n- groups: Map<String, Group>     (ConcurrentHashMap)\n\n+ getInstance(): SplitwiseService                 ← double-checked locking on `volatile instance`\n+ addUser(name, email): User\n+ addGroup(name, members): Group\n+ createExpense(builder)                          <<sync>>  builds Expense, mirrors balance updates on both sheets\n+ settleUp(payerId, payeeId, amount)              <<sync>>  inverse of an expense\n+ showBalanceSheet(userId)\n+ simplifyGroupDebts(groupId): List<Transaction>  greedy creditor/debtor two-pointer match",
      "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "box-service",
      "originalText": "<<singleton>>  SplitwiseService\n───────────────────────────────────────────────\n- users:  Map<String, User>      (ConcurrentHashMap)\n- groups: Map<String, Group>     (ConcurrentHashMap)\n\n+ getInstance(): SplitwiseService                 ← double-checked locking on `volatile instance`\n+ addUser(name, email): User\n+ addGroup(name, members): Group\n+ createExpense(builder)                          <<sync>>  builds Expense, mirrors balance updates on both sheets\n+ settleUp(payerId, payeeId, amount)              <<sync>>  inverse of an expense\n+ showBalanceSheet(userId)\n+ simplifyGroupDebts(groupId): List<Transaction>  greedy creditor/debtor two-pointer match",
      "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.4, "baseline": 15
    },

