      "text": "Legend\n───────────\nYellow  enum\nGreen   core entity (Identity / Group)\nOrange  immutable value object\nBlue    Strategy interface + impls\nPink    facade / singleton service\n\n──→  composes / uses (solid)\n--→  implements / depends-on (dashed)",
